(7557355, 1211379, 67688, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Love the doors, the tiling of the floor and the background .With the modern bike in the background, the image is brought to modern times but without it , we could be looking at the same scene from a very long time ago.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Love the doors, the tiling of the floor and the background .With the modern bike in the background, the image is brought to modern times but without it , we could be looking at the same scene from a very long time ago.', '2018-02-04 12:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
