(7557370, 1211123, 140305, '<td valign="top">I thought this must be somewhere in Scotland, had to google it. Isle of Skye - of course. Love the atmospheric conditions in this shot, really adds to the drama. Beautiful image!</td>', 'I thought this must be somewhere in Scotland, had to google it. Isle of Skye - of course. Love the atmospheric conditions in this shot, really adds to the drama. Beautiful image!', '2018-02-04 14:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557372, 1211352, 140305, '<td valign="top">My husband and I were at Kylemore in September of 2017. They were doing some restoration work so the left side of the building was covered in scaffolding, perhaps in this photo as well? At any rate, the weather looks about the same as we had. Gorgeous place though, thoroughly enjoyed every minute of the tour. Great photo by the way!</td>', 'My husband and I were at Kylemore in September of 2017. They were doing some restoration work so the left side of the building was covered in scaffolding, perhaps in this photo as well? At any rate, the weather looks about the same as we had. Gorgeous place though, thoroughly enjoyed every minute of the tour. Great photo by the way!', '2018-02-04 14:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557373, 1211034, 140305, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot</td>', 'Fabulous shot', '2018-02-04 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557374, 1211264, 140305, '<td valign="top">surreal! I hope you will include the location in your notes. Beautiful image.</td>', 'surreal! I hope you will include the location in your notes. Beautiful image.', '2018-02-04 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557375, 1211089, 140305, '<td valign="top">I think I would have been running for cover...great shot!</td>', 'I think I would have been running for cover...great shot!', '2018-02-04 14:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557532, 1210947, 170281, '<td valign="top">What a terrific image.  I rarely see two of these creatures together, let alone entwined.</td>', 'What a terrific image.  I rarely see two of these creatures together, let alone entwined.', '2018-02-05 11:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557557, 1211378, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great structure in the clouds and nice composition.</td>', 'Great structure in the clouds and nice composition.', '2018-02-05 13:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557559, 1211003, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, only (nitpicking) point of criticism is that I think it''s a pity her hand is in front of her head. Would love to see the rest of the expression. But overall a great capture!</td>', 'Lovely image, only (nitpicking) point of criticism is that I think it''s a pity her hand is in front of her head. Would love to see the rest of the expression. But overall a great capture!', '2018-02-05 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557560, 1211286, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice view, good use of the rule of thirds, but unfortunately lots of the foreground is not in focus and I think that is just a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice view, good use of the rule of thirds, but unfortunately lots of the foreground is not in focus and I think that is just a bit distracting.', '2018-02-05 13:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557561, 1211039, 147314, '<td valign="top">The out of focus foreground is a bit distracting, but lovely portrait of a happy kid.</td>', 'The out of focus foreground is a bit distracting, but lovely portrait of a happy kid.', '2018-02-05 13:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557562, 1210708, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice POV and I like the overall processing, but I think you should have dealt with the strong halos between land and sky.</td>', 'Nice POV and I like the overall processing, but I think you should have dealt with the strong halos between land and sky.', '2018-02-05 13:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557563, 1211272, 147314, '<td valign="top">Strong contrasting (complementary) colours, nice!</td>', 'Strong contrasting (complementary) colours, nice!', '2018-02-05 13:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557564, 1210770, 170281, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of lines.  I like the structure in the sky.</td>', 'Good composition and use of lines.  I like the structure in the sky.', '2018-02-05 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557566, 1211078, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great cloud structure enhanced by classic B &amp; W.  Nice!</td>', 'Great cloud structure enhanced by classic B & W.  Nice!', '2018-02-05 14:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557567, 1211090, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the HDR effect with splashes of color.</td>', 'I like the HDR effect with splashes of color.', '2018-02-05 14:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557568, 1211269, 170281, '<td valign="top">That is going to leave a bruise.  Great shot!</td>', 'That is going to leave a bruise.  Great shot!', '2018-02-05 14:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557569, 1211352, 170281, '<td valign="top">There is an interesting effect which must be due to the angle of the shot.  The castle and its foothold are level, but the waterline looks like it slants up to the right.  The cloud structure is excellent.  I wonder what it would like like with a little added highlighting on the castle.</td>', 'There is an interesting effect which must be due to the angle of the shot.  The castle and its foothold are level, but the waterline looks like it slants up to the right.  The cloud structure is excellent.  I wonder what it would like like with a little added highlighting on the castle.', '2018-02-05 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557570, 1211272, 170281, '<td valign="top">This definitely has a wow factor.  Very nice.</td>', 'This definitely has a wow factor.  Very nice.', '2018-02-05 14:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557571, 1211346, 170281, '<td valign="top">I am not a big fan of food pictures, but this is well done.  The simplicity of the presentation and colors is very appealing.  It looks terribly delicious too!</td>', 'I am not a big fan of food pictures, but this is well done.  The simplicity of the presentation and colors is very appealing.  It looks terribly delicious too!', '2018-02-05 14:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557572, 1210765, 170281, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  It is always great to see a simple subject turned into a visually appealing image.</td>', 'Good composition.  It is always great to see a simple subject turned into a visually appealing image.', '2018-02-05 14:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557574, 1211120, 170281, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lighting just those things you really want us to see.</td>', 'Excellent use of lighting just those things you really want us to see.', '2018-02-05 14:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557621, 1211123, 38162, '<td valign="top">DOF issues perhaps - would prefer more of an f11 look here with falls in focus.  super composition.  gl.</td>', 'DOF issues perhaps - would prefer more of an f11 look here with falls in focus.  super composition.  gl.', '2018-02-05 22:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557633, 1210637, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a striking scene.. the haze in the background really helps focus on the subjects. I am divided on the cropping off of the players. I wonder if a lower viewpoint taking in the whole scene would have improved the shot. Good work, and good luck</td>', 'This is a striking scene.. the haze in the background really helps focus on the subjects. I am divided on the cropping off of the players. I wonder if a lower viewpoint taking in the whole scene would have improved the shot. Good work, and good luck', '2018-02-06 03:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557634, 1210828, 19959, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot :)</td>', 'Intriguing shot :)', '2018-02-06 03:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557946, 1211039, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful face, especially her eyes. I would have preferred a crop on the ROT to cut out some of the busyness on the left, I think. And a solid-colored dress, but that would be difficult to edit into existence.</td>', 'Beautiful face, especially her eyes. I would have preferred a crop on the ROT to cut out some of the busyness on the left, I think. And a solid-colored dress, but that would be difficult to edit into existence.', '2018-02-07 11:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
