(7557951, 1210886, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, how beautiful! Love, love, love the detail and DOF. I''ve only seen these from a distance so I particularly appreciate this image.</td>', 'Oh, how beautiful! Love, love, love the detail and DOF. I''ve only seen these from a distance so I particularly appreciate this image.', '2018-02-07 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557956, 1211123, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the mist adding mystery (see what I did there?) above. Very nice long exposure.</td>', 'Love the mist adding mystery (see what I did there?) above. Very nice long exposure.', '2018-02-07 12:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557958, 1210988, 65234, '<td valign="top">The rest of the herd may be just out of sight to the left, but I don''t know, since the elephant can see what I cannot. I just see a wistful gaze into the bush. Well done. (And as an aside, did the elephant sit on that tree LOL?)</td>', 'The rest of the herd may be just out of sight to the left, but I don''t know, since the elephant can see what I cannot. I just see a wistful gaze into the bush. Well done. (And as an aside, did the elephant sit on that tree LOL?)', '2018-02-07 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557959, 1211034, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image. Just enough light for the boatman and the rest of the scene in faded light. Makes me wonder ... well, lots of things. So literally wonder-ful to me.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image. Just enough light for the boatman and the rest of the scene in faded light. Makes me wonder ... well, lots of things. So literally wonder-ful to me.', '2018-02-07 12:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557960, 1211269, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ouch! And he''d best recover quickly from the fall; that bull is eyeing him in a rather malicious way =:-0</td>', 'Ouch! And he''d best recover quickly from the fall; that bull is eyeing him in a rather malicious way =:-0', '2018-02-07 12:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557962, 1211338, 65234, '<td valign="top">I remember these guys! Not the specific challenge, but the insane cuteness of what most people consider vermin. They''re still adorable here. So very well captured.</td>', 'I remember these guys! Not the specific challenge, but the insane cuteness of what most people consider vermin. They''re still adorable here. So very well captured.', '2018-02-07 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557963, 1211344, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully autumnal (in the northern hemisphere) color palette. Gorgeous soft light, too. An exemplary still life to my eye.</td>', 'Wonderfully autumnal (in the northern hemisphere) color palette. Gorgeous soft light, too. An exemplary still life to my eye.', '2018-02-07 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557964, 1211285, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love this! What great perspective. I keep trying to capture mist in my valley and can''t quite get it. Clearly I need to try from a higher vantage point. And find a cute little house on a ridge ;-)</td>', 'Love this! What great perspective. I keep trying to capture mist in my valley and can''t quite get it. Clearly I need to try from a higher vantage point. And find a cute little house on a ridge ;-)', '2018-02-07 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557965, 1210994, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, my, what big eyes you have! And hairy little antennae. Quite the macro.</td>', 'Oh, my, what big eyes you have! And hairy little antennae. Quite the macro.', '2018-02-07 12:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557966, 1211264, 65234, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful scene; well-captured. Little people provide a sense of scale.</td>', 'Such a beautiful scene; well-captured. Little people provide a sense of scale.', '2018-02-07 12:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557967, 1210947, 65234, '<td valign="top">How cool! I''ve never seen herons do this.</td>', 'How cool! I''ve never seen herons do this.', '2018-02-07 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557968, 1210611, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love that mischievous eye.</td>', 'Love that mischievous eye.', '2018-02-07 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
